    <section>
      <div class="section-head"><h2>Why Readers Trust WellSource</h2></div>
      <div class="pillars">
        <article class="pillar"><h4>For you, by experts</h4><p>Medical writers and clinicians collaborate to simplify complex topics.</p></article>
        <article class="pillar"><h4>Built to move you forward</h4><p>Every story includes practical next steps you can use today.</p></article>
        <article class="pillar"><h4>Reviewed by professionals</h4><p>Clinical reviewers verify accuracy before publication.</p></article>
        <article class="pillar"><h4>Always up to date</h4><p>Articles are refreshed with emerging research and guideline changes.</p></article>
      </div>

      <div class="newsletter">
        <div>
          <h2>Get weekly wellness guidance you can trust</h2>
          <p>Join readers receiving evidence-backed tips, editor picks, and expert explainers in one concise email.</p>
